  "description": "Seo-Yun Mun’s life has been a rollercoaster of heartaches—losing his mom, dealing with his dad’s cheating, and abandoning his beloved piano. But one constant has been his best friend, Yeon-Jae U. Surprise, surprise, Seo-Yun’s head over heels for him, but Yeon-Jae already has a girlfriend. What makes it spicy? Yeon-Jae is all about pushing those boundaries, blurring the lines between friendship and something… deeper.\n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
